WEBVTT

00:25:58.704 --> 00:26:01.371
That's what I've told young people
all around the world,

00:26:01.371 --> 00:26:05.163
and so many have come up to me or
written to me and said, Jane,

00:26:05.163 --> 00:26:08.788
I want to thank you, because you taught
me that because you did it.

00:26:08.996 --> 00:26:10.246
I can do it to.

00:26:11.246 --> 00:26:13.746
That's that's it's so moving to hear

00:26:13.746 --> 00:26:16.288
and it's clear you not
only found her right,

00:26:16.413 --> 00:26:20.163
you cleared the path for so many others
to follow in your footsteps.

00:26:20.871 --> 00:26:23.704
Do you have techniques or strategies
to maintain your patience

00:26:23.704 --> 00:26:24.954
and delay gratifications?

00:26:25.996 --> 00:26:27.538
No, I never thought of it.

00:26:27.538 --> 00:26:31.288
I mean, like just born that way, you know,
I was obviously born patient,